  "Question": "Line \\(l\\) passes through a point \\(A\\) on a circle. How can you prove that it is a tangent?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "Draw \\(OA\\) and prove \\(OA\\perp l\\)",
    "B": "Prove that \\(l\\) passes through the center \\(O\\)",
